      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "padding": 44,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hRmFJ",
          "name": "NT",
          "fill": "#2B141C",
          "content": "LS-21／LS-119 · 實作註記 Handoff Notes",
          "lineHeight": 1.25,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
          "fontSize": 34,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "p0RrGB",
          "name": "NS",
          "fill": "#553040",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "時間軸／日記編輯器／日記詳情三畫面群，R3 修稿＋R4 收斂輪。量測值單一真相來源：本板寫一次，其他地方一律「見本板」。戳記制沿用 LS-111 jftM0 的規則（⑧-1 主張須量測、⑧-2 量測值單一真相來源）；R3 段落標 R3，R4 新增／更正段落標 R4（R3 段落中對照原申報的更正文字直接改寫在原處並註明「R3 申報…有誤」）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "ZssTe",
          "name": "N 建立入口：FAB → 導覽列按鈕（BL-1／BL-2／MJ-13）",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "padding": [
            34,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "F1cgpN",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "#2B141C",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "建立入口：FAB → 導覽列按鈕（BL-1／BL-2／MJ-13）",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "l4Ouo",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "T3UIt",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R3 · 11 全家族",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r3VG4f",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "撤回 R2「PLAN.md 明訂 FAB」的引據——經查 docs/PLAN.md 全檔 269 行 0 命中 FAB／浮動／floating action，屬虛構。時間軸首頁的建立入口改為導覽列右側具名按鈕「+ 新增回憶」（新建 reusable cmp/Create Entry Button（zy3Ps）；LS-47 四板內嵌 FAB frame 未動，同步另記 LS-96）：pill 形，padding [$ctl-pad-tap 9.5, $sp-item 16]，icon-sm 18＋fs-body 17 label，高度由 padding 推導＝44pt（實測 44）。放進 Header Row（與畫面標題同列，justifyContent:space_between），不再絕對定位、不再浮在捲動內容之上。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "AR5UW",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "RpEly",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R3 · 例外論證",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kh7Xw",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "這不是逐字套用釘底動作帶（Action Bar：hairline＋Button Wrap 釘在 Home Indicator 之上）的慣例，是刻意的例外——時間軸是 Tab-root 畫面，底部已有一顆全 app 共用、絕對定位的浮動膠囊 Tab Bar（cmp/Tab Bar，361×64，x16，y＝板高−98）。若在 Tab Bar 之上再疊一條釘底 Action Bar，Tab Bar 的 y 必須跟著上移（852 板：754→661），但其他分頁（相簿／寶貝／設定）沒有這個新增列，Tab Bar 位置會隨分頁不同而跳動——這違反「狀態切換不搬動版面」精神，而且是跨分頁的，比單一畫面內的版面穩定更根本。改用導覽列按鈕後 Tab Bar 完全不用動，且滿足 BL-2 的硬條件：按鈕在固定版面裡，Feed 捲動時按鈕位置不變、永遠不會疊到任何卡片內容（結構性保證，不是量出來的座標剛好沒撞到）。此論證請 reviewer 對抗；若判定不成立，需要的替代方案是全 app Tab Bar 統一上移 109pt（93+16），這會影響本票以外的所有 Tab-root 畫面，建議留給另一票處理。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "EZmZA",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cU0DS",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#8E2447",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "R3 · MJ-13 處置",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kE5pl",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "LS-47 既有 4 板（V5bD0/PIwjk/oP9Ey/VLg6j，寶貝切換情境的時間軸）與 iPad 的 swGD5 仍是舊形態（56×56 純 icon／44×44 圓鈕，皆無文字標籤）。本票不回改這 4+1 張既有已核准畫面（越權修改別票交付物），但新建立入口的形態已與 LS-47/iPad 的「導覽列按鈕」哲學一致（都是「入口在固定版面裡，不浮動」）。建議：另開小 chore 把 LS-47 那 4 張的 56×56 icon-only 鈕同步成 cmp/Create Entry Button，或記入 LS-96 待辦池。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "hsplj",
          "name": "N 時間軸 (11) 版面節奏",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "padding": [
            34,
            0,
