                      "fontWeight": "700"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "b7xDfh",
                      "name": "Paragraph",
                      "fill": "$text-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "1.1　本條款是您與本服務營運者之間具有法律效力的協議。當您登入、建立家庭、加入家庭或以任何方式使用本服務，即表示您已閱讀、理解並同意本條款及《隱私權政策》。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eFnjQ",
                      "name": "Paragraph",
                      "fill": "$text-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "1.2　透過 Apple App Store 取得本 App 的使用者，另受 Apple 的《授權應用程式使用者授權合約》及我們的《EULA 附加條款》拘束。本條款與該等文件有牴觸時，就 Apple 與 App Store 相關事項以 Apple 標準 EULA 為準，其餘以本條款為準。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zNJGE",
                      "name": "Paragraph",
                      "fill": "$text-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "1.3　若您不同意本條款的任何部分，請勿使用本服務，並可依相關條款刪除帳號。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "q6XhI8",
                      "name": "Section Heading",
                      "fill": "$text-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "2. 服務內容",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
