      "name": "Import / 實作註記 · Handoff Notes (ios-dev)",
      "width": 900,
      "fill": "#FBEBEC",
      "cornerRadius": 24,
      "stroke": "#BC969D",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 24,
      "padding": 44,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zxjRa",
          "name": "NT",
          "fill": "#2B141C",
          "content": "LS-251 相機膠卷批次匯入 · Handoff Notes",
          "lineHeight": 1.25,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
          "fontSize": 34,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xSXtN",
          "name": "NS",
          "fill": "#553040",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "R1 首輪產出。系統 PHPickerViewController 不設計，只設計選完之後的流程：01 匯入整理頁／02 日期不明群／03 上限與規則提示／04 匯入進度（沿 LS-142 上傳佇列樣式，只補批次總進度列與取消整批確認）／04b 取消整批確認／05 完成摘要／06a limited-library／06b 拒絕權限空狀態，各含 iPhone 淺/深色、AX3、iPad 11\"（04b 僅 iPhone 淺色，理由見「範圍取捨」節）。新增 cmp/Baby Chip（o9Brs1）多選寶貝元件。未改動任何既有已核可板。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "IIBGz",
          "name": "狀態機（選取→整理→上傳→摘要）",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "padding": [
            34,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NHTkJ",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "#2B141C",
              "content": "狀態機（選取→整理→上傳→摘要）",
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 22,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qVIKg",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "unOnW",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#7A3B48",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "LS-251 R1",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fZYWK",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "①選取：系統 PHPickerViewController 多選（不設計，入口為相簿詳情「加入照片」／時間軸「＋」，見 LS-249 Story）。②整理：01 匯入整理頁——依 EXIF 拍攝日期分組，每群可指定寶貝（cmp/Baby Chip 多選）、目標相簿、整群略過；02 是「日期不明」群的特化態（同一頁面的其中一群，非獨立路由）；03 是「已達上限」時 01 的內容變化態（同一頁面，非獨立路由）。按「開始匯入 N 張」離開整理態、進入上傳態。③上傳：04 匯入進度——全螢幕（非 sheet，因為這是從系統選圖器銜接來的獨立流程，不像 LS-142 是疊在相簿詳情上的動作），按「取消匯入」彈出 04b 確認 sheet。④摘要：完成或使用者手動結束背景等待後進入 05；05 的「重試失敗項」按下後回到③上傳態（不新增畫面，佇列邏輯與 LS-142 相同）。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "HJ5oR",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "O46r4",
                  "name": "stamp",
                  "fill": "#7A3B48",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 118,
                  "content": "LS-251 R1",
                  "lineHeight": 1.42,
                  "textAlign": "right",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wDVRO",
                  "name": "l",
                  "fill": "#2B141C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "整理頁（01/02/03）三者是同一張畫面的三種內容組合，不是三個獨立路由：02 示範「日期不明」群卡片長什麼樣子，03 示範「接近/達到上限」時頂部橫幅與底部規則提示長什麼樣子；實作時這些都是 01 畫面依資料狀態渲染的條件內容，不要拆成三個 View。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "y4ujjU",
              "name": "i",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 10,
              "children": [
