                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "public.growth_records：id uuid pk、family_id uuid not null（fk families）、child_id uuid not null（複合 fk (family_id,child_id)→children）、author_id uuid（fk profiles，on delete set null）、measured_on date not null、height_cm numeric(5,1)、weight_kg numeric(5,2)、head_cm numeric(5,1)、note text（可空，若填 1–2000 字 btrim 後）、created_at／updated_at timestamptz、deleted_at／deleted_by（僅 delete_growth_record RPC 可寫）。CHECK：三項量測至少一項非空；各項若有填須 >0。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
