                  "fill": "$print-ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "list_growth_records(p_child_id, p_limit=50, p_before, p_before_id) → setof growth_records，measured_on desc, id desc。upsert_growth_record(p_id, p_child_id, p_measured_on, p_height_cm, p_weight_kg, p_head_cm, p_note) → growth_records：p_id NULL＝新增（owner/member），非 NULL＝更新內容（僅原作者本人）。delete_growth_record(p_id) → void：軟刪，作者本人或該家庭 owner，SECURITY DEFINER。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                  "fontSize": 17,
